                        "entry_id": "88fbbf12-9475-388c-babb-1f48a09d39e0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The quality of being right, just, or reasonable; justice, truth; dependence, trustworthiness; reasonableness."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dialectal",
                            "rare",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c3e6149-244d-44c2-9973-b5bd9b45981f",
                                "sense_id": "263e8dfb-1cb8-31b3-a5c6-6797cb7f7005",
                                "text": "There's no rightship in so much fighting over nothing but what's fair."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e555236f-2d1a-4df7-a9d8-a0e7bc243987",
                                "sense_id": "263e8dfb-1cb8-31b3-a5c6-6797cb7f7005",
                                "text": "He spoke with firm conviction, as if the rightship of this to any English understanding must be beyond doubt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "070cb965-f40c-40f2-ab9c-ff0136fef4e4",
                                "sense_id": "263e8dfb-1cb8-31b3-a5c6-6797cb7f7005",
                                "text": "Othertimes the rightship o't not zo plain: the path do varky, an' 'tes a hardish job to zee which vark to volly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8eea7910-10b6-4e98-9da6-ed6f971430ba",
                                "sense_id": "263e8dfb-1cb8-31b3-a5c6-6797cb7f7005",
                                "text": "Of course, this was very disturbing, so the services of a 'white witch' were sought, and 'he mumbled a lot of stuff what nobody could make any rightship of, and weeshed (wished) him back to the Pit again.'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
